OL,3,GNEWSA'Unbelievable growth' for cruise
OL,4,Aship tourism in north west
OL,5,
OL,6,FCruise ship tourism, described as
OL,7,F"invaluable" for the north west
OL,8,Feconomy, is set to expand in 2027, BBC
OL,9,FNews NI has learned.
OL,11,FFoyle Port has three landing areas -
OL,12,Fone at Lisahally outside Londonderry,
OL,13,Fanother at Fort George in the city
OL,14,Fcentre and a third at Greencastle,
OL,15,FCounty Donegal.
OL,17,FThese harbours saw almost 12,000
OL,18,Fpassengers arrive between April and
OL,19,FSeptember 2026.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
